# The Gobbiebag Part VII (jeuno 93) with its era module (quest rework B3b Jeuno, P4):
# modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/the_gobbiebag_part_1_to_10.lua, enabled by xi.pre(xi.expansion.SOA) (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_SOA 0), raises the part's fame level to 7 (states 1 and 2's checks replaced) and adds state 3 (available, the
# start size, the previous part, fame below 7: 42 with the inventory + 1). The inventory at 60 (storage, after a first
# talk at 30: no state 3, 43 (81)), Parts I-VI completed (the chain's earlier parts, by a GM). Fame level 6 (975 / 2 =
# 487): state 3's 42 (61); Part VI set accepted (a GM): no section (43 (81)); completed again; fame level 7 (976, a GM):
# 43 (61, 0, 1), begun; accepted at fame level 6: the module's state 2 check fails: no section, a trade: nothing; at 7:
# the four items: 73 (66), completed. A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it
# completed).
module modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/the_gobbiebag_part_1_to_10.lua
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
fame Sandoria 975
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartV completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed
item SquareOfLynxLeather
item AdamanIngot
item SquareOfRainbowCloth
item Deathstone
login
trigger Bluffnix                        # available, fame below the era level, the inventory 30, not 60: no state 3; 43 (81)
finish
storage inventory 60                    # a GM: the part's start size
trigger Bluffnix                        # fame level 6, below the era level: state 3: 42 (61)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi accepted # a GM
trigger Bluffnix                        # state 3: the previous part not completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartVi completed # a GM
fame Sandoria 976                       # a GM: fame level 7
trigger Bluffnix                        # the module's state 1 check: 43 (61, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
fame Sandoria 975                       # a GM: fame level 6
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the module's state 2 check fails: no section; 43 (81)
finish
trade Bluffnix SquareOfLynxLeather x1 AdamanIngot x1 SquareOfRainbowCloth x1 Deathstone x1 # no section: nothing
fame Sandoria 976                       # a GM
trade Bluffnix SquareOfLynxLeather x1 AdamanIngot x1 SquareOfRainbowCloth x1 Deathstone x1 # the module's state 2 check: 73 (66)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 65; INVENTORY_INCREASED
